"""Staffing and recruitment agencies: resume screening, timesheets to payroll and billing, worker compliance.

Rules for this file: resumes are screened only on evidence against the job order's stated requirements, never on age,
gender, origin, health or any other protected trait, and candidates are listed, never ranked by the assistant; the
recruiter decides who to call. Work authorization is tracked by document type and expiry date only. Pay, overtime and
placement rules are the agency's own policies, never quoted as the law.
"""
from mk import (D, F, Tbl, Draft, upload, process, review, X, exceptions, compare, draft, approve, R, write,
                Sec, Chart, report, calendar, case)

